    "title": "在 … 上/下/中",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-frames-r5-05-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "在 … 上/下/中",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "在 + activity or process + 中 sets the context in which the statement applies. 在学习中 means in the course of learning, rather than inside a physical place. 上 can mark an abstract domain, 下 a condition, and 中 an ongoing process; these localizers are not interchangeable.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "在学习中，问清楚很重要。",
                "pinyin": "zài xuéxí zhōng ， wèn qīngchu hěn zhòngyào 。",
                "meaning": "In learning, asking until things are clear is important.",
                "audio": "38702b3cd35b2a585d5a1b3c5374dbbd0af7de3e3dbd74e68ba3af78fa39abc4"
              },
              {
                "text": "他在学习上帮助我。",
                "pinyin": "tā zài xuéxí shàng bāngzhù wǒ 。",
                "meaning": "He helps me in my studies.",
                "audio": "ff5fac2a02b1549f29cc40d4bd7a0d90cf0c649d291edc056ad4b2a02a418f8c"
              },
              {
                "text": "在老师的帮助下，我们都学会了。",
                "pinyin": "zài lǎoshī de bāngzhù xià ， wǒmen dōu xuéhuì le 。",
                "meaning": "With the teacher’s help, we all learned how to do it.",
                "audio": "876fd6cd6e61f39ed0fe6a8eff3aea609f5d2955e56b0044e5045c7575901617"
              },
              {
                "text": "我们在学习中发现问题。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen zài xuéxí zhōng fāxiàn wèntí 。",
                "meaning": "We discover problems in the process of learning.",
                "audio": "519a1edb3b1721d7f33507c4d923153021d6b0a8f416b16f19f88597d9c73090"
              }
            ]
          },
